-- הסכם קיבוצי מיום 10.8.1995 — הפרשה לקופת גמל בגין רכיבי שכר ותשלומים
-- אחרים שאינם פנסיוניים: the public-sector agreement between the State, the
-- Centre of Local Government, the three large cities, the Jewish Agency
-- (with the World Zionist Organisation, the Jewish National Fund and Keren
-- Hayesod) and the institutions of higher education, and the New General
-- Histadrut. The wage agreements of 1993–1996 of the engineers, the
-- academics, the technicians and other unions ("הסכמי השכר") had agreed an
-- accrual pension on part of the components that are not pensionable; the
-- employers said that cannot be done for an employee on a budgetary pension
-- without amending the State Service (Pensions) Law, so until that is
-- legislated this agreement sets an interim arrangement: from 1.1.1995 the
-- employer contributes 5% and deducts 5% to a provident fund on the
-- components of annex ב' (overtime, extra work, premiums, car and travel
-- expenses, subsistence), from 1.1.1996 also on those of annex ג' (car
-- insurance and licence fees), and from 1.6.1997 on every component that is
-- not pensionable, save the tax gross-up (§5); whom it covers (§2); the
-- fund and the accrual pension (§3); the money is the employee's (§6); the
-- right to stay in the arrangement while the "veteran members" dispute
-- stands (§7, annex ה'); the one-time compensation of those who retired
-- from 1.1.93 to the start (§8); no double contribution (§9); nothing more
-- (§10); the legislation and the end of the arrangement (§11); the wage
-- agreements stand, no retroactive claim (§12); the unions' choices when it
-- ends (§13); a better arrangement for another union (§14); §§15–16; and
-- the cost frame (annex ו': 2.15%, 2.5% and 3% of the pension salary,
-- against the wage agreements' 2%).
--
-- Whom it covers: an employee graded in a scale annex א' lists, whose
-- union signed or joins, at an employer that signed or joins (§2(א)). It
-- covers no teaching employee: the teaching scale is not in annex א' (a
-- closed list), and neither הסתדרות המורים nor ארגון המורים signed it or,
-- in the corpus, joined it (the Collective Agreements Law §§15–16,
-- imported). The list names "גננים" (F-framework-1995-a). The teachers'
-- instruments of the same subject — §14 of הסתדרות המורים's agreement of
-- 19.9.94 (not yet encoded) and §5 of ארגון המורים's of 31.8.94 (2% for
-- 1993–1996), the two agreements of 8.9.98 (§10: from 1.1.98, 0.8%, the
-- exhaustion of those sections) and the two of 17.12.98 that carry them out
-- — are held against it in
-- l4/tests/1998-12-17_histadrut-hamorim_provident-fund-tests.l4. It speaks
-- to no pay item of l4/lib/vocabulary.l4 and is in no root.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT parties
IMPORT conventions
IMPORT vocabulary
IMPORT collective_agreements_law

-- not weighed against `the Hours of Work and Rest Law`: names overtime pay
-- only as a component on which provident-fund contributions are deducted and
-- paid; the hours, and the premium §16 asks on them, are untouched.

§ `הסכם קיבוצי — הפרשה לקופת גמל בגין רכיבי שכר שאינם פנסיוניים (10.8.1995)`

DECLARE `1995 provident-fund action` IS ONE OF
    `contribute and deduct 5% each to a provident fund under the agreement of 10.8.1995`
    `make the retroactive contribution of 10.8.1995 in the first salary after the funds are chosen`
    `pay the one-time compensation of 10.8.1995 to a retiree`
    `submit the bill amending the State Service (Pensions) Law under the agreement of 10.8.1995`
    `draft the bill of 10.8.1995 with the Histadrut's agreement`
    `cooperate with the Histadrut on the regulations of 10.8.1995`
    `transfer provident-fund deposits to an accrual pension fund under the agreement of 10.8.1995`
    `claim a retroactive contribution under the wage agreements for the interim period`
    `submit the agreement of 10.8.1995 for registration`

