-- akn:preamble/p11 The Histadrut's short name; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p19 The words of agreement that introduce the clauses; no rule.
-- akn:conclusions The agreement's sign-off: a label row with no text of its own.
-- akn:conclusions/p1 "In witness whereof the parties signed"; no rule.
-- akn:conclusions/t1 The signature block of the six parties; no rule.
-- akn:conclusions/p2 The heading of the list of annexes; no rule.
-- akn:conclusions/p3 The name of annex א' (the list of scales); no rule.
-- akn:conclusions/p4 The name of annex ב' (the components from 1.1.95); no rule.
-- akn:conclusions/p5 The name of annex ג' (the components from 1.1.96); no rule.
-- akn:conclusions/p6 The name of annex ד' (the components from 1.6.97); no rule.
-- akn:conclusions/p7 The name of annex ה' (the dispute over recognition as "veteran members"); no rule.
-- akn:conclusions/p8 The name of annex ו' (the costs); no rule.
-- akn:attachments The frame of the annexes: a label row with no text of its own.

