-- ¶12: the memorandum of understanding of 21.7.93, to examine bringing
-- components and payments into an accrual pension or a provident fund;
-- ¶13: after the Finance Minister's agreement of 18.4.94 with the
-- engineers', academics' and technicians' unions, their wage agreements of
-- 1993–1996 agreed an accrual pension on part of the components that are
-- not pensionable, and a joint committee; ¶14: other unions' agreements of
-- the same years agreed an accrual pension or a provident fund on part of
-- them; ¶15: those agreements are "הסכמי השכר". None is in the corpus.
@ref akn:preamble/p12 akn:preamble/p13 akn:preamble/p14 akn:preamble/p15
