    LIST `outside the corpus` "מזכר ההבנה מיום 21.7.93",
         `outside the corpus` "ההסכמה בין שר האוצר להסתדרויות המהנדסים, המח\"ר, ההנדסאים והטכנאים מיום 18.4.94",
         `outside the corpus` "הסכמי השכר לשנים 1993–1996 של האיגודים החתומים על ההסכם מיום 10.8.1995 או המצטרפים אליו"

`the years the wage agreements of 10.8.1995 cover` MEANS LIST 1993, 1994, 1995, 1996

-- ¶16: in the joint committee the employers said the accrual pension on
-- those components cannot be given to an employee entitled to a budgetary
-- pension without amending the State Service (Pensions) Law (outside the
-- corpus); ¶17: so the Treasury submits a bill, drafted with the
-- Histadrut's agreement (§11); ¶18: until it is legislated, the parties
-- reached the interim arrangement of this agreement.
@ref akn:preamble/p16 akn:preamble/p17 akn:preamble/p18
`why the State Service (Pensions) Law is not in the agreement of 10.8.1995` MEANS
    `outside the corpus` "חוק שירות המדינה (גמלאות)"

`the 1995 provident fund is an interim arrangement until the legislation` MEANS TRUE

§§ `1 המבוא והנספחים`

@ref akn:art_1
`the 1995 provident-fund agreement's preamble and annexes are part of it` MEANS TRUE

-- The annexes' names are for convenience only and bear on no reading.
