`the names of the 1995 annexes bear on its reading` MEANS FALSE

§§ `2 תחולה`

-- (א): every employee graded in a scale annex א' lists, temporary and
-- provisional employees included, provided the union of his scale signed
-- this agreement or gives written notice that it joins, at the employers
-- that signed and those that join, as (ב) says. (ב): the agreement and its
-- annexes are an annex of the 1993–1996 wage agreement of every union that
-- signed it or joins.
@desc An employee, as far as the agreement of 10.8.1995 asks whether it reaches him.
DECLARE `1995 provident-fund employee` HAS
    `his scale, for 10.8.1995` IS A STRING @desc the scale he is graded in, as annex א' would name it
    `his scale's union signed or joined the agreement of 10.8.1995` IS A BOOLEAN
    `his employer signed or joined the agreement of 10.8.1995` IS A BOOLEAN
    `temporary or provisional, for 10.8.1995` IS A BOOLEAN

-- Annex א': the scales, a closed list (convention reading.closed-list).
-- The administrative scale includes the National Insurance Institute's and
-- the Employment Service's; the academics' includes the psychologists; the
-- nurses' join by a separate agreement under their own wage agreement and
-- this one. Each scale stands beside a line for its union's signature,
-- left blank in the corpus. The list names "גננים" and not the teaching
-- scale (F-framework-1995-a): a teacher graded in the teaching scale,
-- kindergarten teachers among them (the teachers' agreements of those
-- years grade "מורה וגננת" in their own tables), is not in it.
@ref akn:att_1__hc_1/t1
`the scales annex א' of 1995 lists` MEANS
    LIST "מינהלי", "טכנאים והנדסאים", "מח\"ר", "מהנדסים", "אחיד משולב", "מקצטים",
         "עובדים סוציאליים", "משפטנים", "פרקליטים", "פארה רפואיים", "פיזיותרפיסטים",
         "מרפאים בעיסוק", "רנטגן מעשי", "רנטגן מוסמך", "שירות החוץ", "עתונאים",
         "עיתונאים לפי רשות השידור", "עיתונאים הפקה", "ביו-מקרוביולוגיים", "רוקחים",
         "עובדי מחקר", "קלינאי תקשורת", "גננים", "אחיות"

`the 1995 scale that joins by a separate agreement` MEANS "אחיות"

-- F-framework-1995-a's evidence: the list's word is "גננים", and no scale of
-- the list is the teaching scale.
`annex א' of 1995 lists the scale it calls ganannim and not the teaching scale` MEANS
        elem "גננים" `the scales annex א' of 1995 lists`
    AND NOT elem "עובדי הוראה" `the scales annex א' of 1995 lists`

#ASSERT `annex א' of 1995 lists the scale it calls ganannim and not the teaching scale`

@ref akn:art_2__para_a akn:art_2__para_b
